3
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:07.200
Dev, QA, staging, production, every client's copy.

4
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.260
They quietly drift apart, and checking them by hand is slow.

5
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.917
Meet SchemaScope.

6
00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:17.524
Pick the database you trust,

7
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.845
add every copy you want to check,

8
00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:24.487
